Z||000009||88 Fiero||04-21-2000||05:48 PM||||jeff...my car used to be a formula and convert it to a fastback. I did re-wire the whole thing... Also the outside taillights were change with the white back-up lights from an '82 Vette. I have to re-wire this to accommodate the signal and back-up lights...the Inner taillights were my parking lights and brake lights...Cutter..the wing is a GTR wing with the adjustable center blade... it is molded in the deck lid...but lately I've been thinking about going to a full conversion... I have already price a 355 kit convertible..so most likely I might go with that route....||||reg||1
